Subject: [PATCH 1/4] www: document initial Huawei/UniVPN protocol observations

Add a contributor-facing protocol investigation page covering the observed password authentication, IPv4 framing and control/data heartbeat sequence. Link it from New Protocols without advertising a supported OpenConnect protocol.

Keep unknown fields and the limits of one-gateway testing explicit. This documentation does not add a C implementation.

Validation: xmllint, upstream html.py rendering, internal links and git diff --check.

Related-to: https://gitlab.com/openconnect/openconnect/-/issues/603

